Issue 04 done, committed as `e7667bd`.

What changed:
- **Spawn contract**: `SpawnContext.issueRel` removed; harness adapters build the driver line from `ctx.issuePath`, which the engine always sets to the absolute main-checkout Issue file (`engine/spawn.ts`, `engine/engine.ts:1690`). The worktree seed copy remains, context only.
- **Read-back**: `readBack` now reads the main-checkout marker for every attempt and no longer mirrors the worktree copy (`engine/engine.ts:1582`), ending the false-crash/skipped-merge pair.
- **AGENT.md**: `Session.agentMd`/`TicketEnv.agentMd` deleted; `runTicket` re-reads the file at every spawn (`engine/engine.ts:1693`).
- **Tests**: new seam tests for the false-crash regression (done recognised and merged) and the mid-run AGENT.md edit; fake-CLI assertions moved to the absolute path. `bun test` 288 pass, `tsc --noEmit` clean.

Issue file set to `status=done` with all criteria ticked and a Notes section recording the decisions.
